# Debug notes and local tooling never need to reach the build machine.
.debug/
.claude/
docs/

# `tests/` STAYS. `next build` type-checks the whole tsconfig project, which
# includes the *.test.ts(x) files next to the code under components/ and lib/:
# they import `@/tests/_helpers/*` and `@/tests/_fakes/*`, and the jest-dom
# matchers are typed from tests/. Excluding tests/ failed the very first
# production build with 200+ TS2307 / TS2339 errors (W5, docs/deploy.md).
# Only what the type-checker never reads stays out:
tests/e2e/__screenshots__/
tests/perf/baselines/
